WEBVTT

00:00:00.202 --> 00:00:02.459
Some people wait for the perfect setup.

00:00:02.529 --> 00:00:04.441
Arjun doesn't.

00:00:04.729 --> 00:00:07.323
Introducing Arjun Mishra.

00:00:07.393 --> 00:00:12.050
On GitHub's macOS runners, his app is built, tested, signed,

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.759
and shipped to the App Store, all from a Windows PC.

00:00:15.829 --> 00:00:20.050
That app is Roadpack: one live trip for every car in the group,

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:24.559
a paying subscriber within the first six downloads, before any marketing.

00:00:24.629 --> 00:00:26.668
Then he co-founded Mune,

00:00:26.738 --> 00:00:31.195
a finance app where every AI answer happens on your iPhone.

00:00:31.811 --> 00:00:35.668
His forty agents found 86% of real issues.

00:00:35.738 --> 00:00:38.177
A standard checker? 36%.

00:00:38.247 --> 00:00:42.605
At IFS Copperleaf, his internship ended with an offer:

00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:46.186
keep building, part-time, through his final year.

00:00:48.502 --> 00:00:51.141
Two hackathon prizes.

00:00:52.487 --> 00:00:54.709
Put it all together.

00:00:58.237 --> 00:01:00.817
No perfect setup required.

00:01:00.887 --> 00:01:02.392
Arjun Mishra.

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:04.069
Available May 2027,

00:01:05.093 --> 00:01:10.489
for software, forward-deployed, and AI engineering roles.
